IMPORTANT:
==========

If you have an old file, you must replace it with the new one. I gave keys
only to betatesters, but donno. Maybe someone have keyfiles too. If you use 
the old keyfile,GifDecs's task will be suspended forever. !!AGAIN!! Don't 
try to remove checksum! Because this utility works %100 without keyfile 
too. !!

QUICK & ALL INFO! [:-)]:
========================

add these tooltypes to your DOORS:FILEID/FILEID.info

GIF_EX=c:GifDesc e %P %WFILE_ID.DIZ
GIF_AD=c:GifDesc r %P %WFILE_ID.DIZ

